# Agent context. Kept on disk so the tooling still reads it, deliberately unpublished:
# it names the job this project was started for, records the agent-autonomy rules, and
# carries this machine's JAVA_HOME/HADOOP_HOME and Databricks CLI specifics -- none of
# which belong in a public repo whose point is the engineering.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
